  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><strong>Statement:</strong>&nbsp;If I am not feeling well, then I will go to the doctor.</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;I am not feeling well and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;I will go to the doctor.</p><p>The given statement&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></math>.</p><p>We know that the contrapositive of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></math>.</p><p><strong>Contrapositive:</strong> If I will not go to the doctor, then I am feeling well.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
